  "entryPoint": "AnalyzeRule.getString/getStringList (default and URL modes)",
  "expectationSource": "Source-derived, not device-recorded. Read from the frozen AnalyzeRule.getStringList (AnalyzeRule.kt:159-235), AnalyzeByJSoup.getStringList (AnalyzeByJSoup.kt:72-118), AnalyzeByJSonPath.getStringList (AnalyzeByJSonPath.kt:71-123) and AnalyzeRule.getString at 14dd24945b2914ce2708b8abaa4ee67ceef892af, together with the existing product analyze path (HtmlRuleBatch.documentText/documentTextList and JsonSourceRules.list/contentText/extract). The ordered list, scalar twin, per-item ##, empty-list and JSON sibling values are therefore source/product-derived; the frozen APK run that would turn them into a device golden is not-run. The scalar twin of a list rule joins the same matches with a newline and runs ## on that join; the list read runs ## on every item and never entity-unescapes. The getStringListUrl form is a named product refusal when nonempty, so only its supported empty result is present.",
  "documents": {
    "toc": "<div id=\"list\"><li><a href=\"/1\">第一章</a></li><li><a href=\"/2\">第二章</a></li><li><a href=\"/3\">第三章</a></li></div><div id=\"pages\"><a class=\"gr\" href=\"/toc/2\">下一页</a></div>",
    "entity": "<div id=\"code\">A&amp;amp;B</div>",
    "json": "{\"names\":[\"甲\",\"乙\"],\"items\":[{\"name\":\"丙\"},{\"name\":\"丁\"}]}"
  },
  "baseUrl": "http://fixture.test",
  "cases": [
